                <span id="alg2.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Inputs</span>: Forward pass solution <math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z=(x,u)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z=(x,u)</annotation></semantics></math> and matrices <math id="alg2.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(S,\Phi^{-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(S,\Phi^{-1})</annotation></semantics></math>, Loss gradient <math id="alg2.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\partial\ell}{\partial z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\partial\ell}{\partial z}</annotation></semantics></math>, Initial guess <math id="alg2.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\lambda}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>λ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
