<span id="alg2.l2.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#B3B3B3;float:right;"> Eq. <a href="#S3.E8" title="In 3.3 Solving the Linear Systems while Leveraging Parallelism ‣ 3 Differentiable Model Predictive Control on the GPU ‣ Differentiable Model Predictive Controlon the GPU" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a><span id="alg2.l2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
</span></span>
